x;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto\">Bakeries, supermarkets, hotels and neighborhood hubs order Wednesday to Monday — we aggregate demand, buy straight from the farm, and roll any savings into your wallet. Prices locked all week, Tuesday is delivery day.</p><a href=\"/order\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;background:#00E676;color:#0A0A0A;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid #0A0A0A;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #0A0A0A\">Place your order →</a><p><small>Minimum 10 crates • <!-- -->Ordering open — prices locked all week<!-- --> • Prices locked all week • <a href=\"/visuals\">See it fresh</a> • <a href=\"/track\">Track order</a></small></p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:12px\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:2px solid #0A0A0A;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #0A0A0A\"><h3>🔒 Locked all-week prices</h3><p>Large, Medium, Pullet — set Wednesday, honored till Monday night.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:2px solid #0A0A0A;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #0A0A0A\"><h3>💰 Wallet rollover</h3><p>Downgrades and breakage come back as credit on your next order.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:2px solid #0A0A0A;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #0A0A0A\"><h3>🚚 Tuesday drops + crate swap</h3><p>Full crates in, empties out. First order includes crates.</p></div></div><div style=\"background:#7C4DFF;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border:2px solid #0A0A0A\"><h2 style=\"margin-top:0\">Run a neighborhood hub?</h2><p>Depot partners buy 5% below commercial price, sell to Indomie joints and walk-ins, and keep the margin. Same Tuesday truck, same wallet rollover.</p><a href=\"/hub\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0A0A0A;font-weight:800;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none\">Register as a hub</a></div><div style=\"background:#0A0A0A;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px\"><h2 style=\"color:#FFD600;margin-top:0\">How a week runs</h2><p><b>Wednesday morning</b> — Admin sets prices (locked all week)  →  <b>Wed–Mon</b> — you order, funds held  →  <b>Sunday</b> — Admin reviews prices  →  <b>Tuesday AM</b> — farm paid, truck rolls  →  <b>Tuesday PM</b> — delivery + crate swap  →  <b>Night</b> — funds released, credits to wallet.</p><a href=\"/order\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#FFD600;color:#0A0A0A;font-weight:800;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none\">Start your order</a></div></div></div></div><script id=\"__NEXT_DATA__\" type=\"application/json\">{\"props\":{\"pageProps\":{}},\"page\":\"/\",\"query\":{},\"buildId\":\"WmBvFMJXkvxzUjLtcE0ma\",\"nextExport\":true,\"autoExport\":true,\"isFallback\":false,\"scriptLoader\":[]}</script></body></html>","isFullyStaticPage":true}